# Mavly Homepage — Premium Animated Website Showcase Hero

## OBJECTIVE

Upgrade the existing Mavly homepage at `/home` by creating a premium, immersive hero section using all 19 ImageKit images listed in this prompt.

The visual inspiration is the supplied Mavly screenshot: a central brand and authentication area, surrounded by floating website-preview cards of different sizes, positions, and rotations.

The final result should feel polished, editorial, tactile, modern, and alive. The website-preview images should create the impression that Mavly can transform ideas into beautiful websites.

This is an enhancement of the existing homepage, not a complete website rewrite.

**The three non-negotiable requirements are:**

1. Use all 19 supplied ImageKit images in the hero's visual composition or intentional animation cycle.
2. Build premium, fluid, carefully choreographed animations inspired by the general visual quality of Emergent's website.
3. Preserve Mavly's existing black-and-white brand direction, actual logo, headline, Google/GitHub authentication functionality, and current route structure.

Do not stop after describing a plan. Inspect the project, implement the page, and verify the rendered result.

