- Show a smaller number of preview cards at any one time.
- Use the available supplied assets within the same image-slot system if necessary.
- Keep card motion restrained.
- Remove or disable pointer parallax.
- Avoid large cards that cover the centre.
- Prevent horizontal overflow.
- Ensure both authentication buttons fit comfortably within the viewport.
- Keep the legal notice readable.
- Respect the user's reduced-motion preference.

Do not render all 19 images at full desktop dimensions on a mobile screen.

The mobile version should still feel intentional, premium, and recognisably part of the same brand.

